//name -> Emote Name
//fileName -> filename of the emote without path
//command -> chat command for the emote without /
//animated -> 1=animated(apng) 0=normal png
//frameTime	-> time in ms each frame is visible (smaller -> faster animation, higher -> slower animation)
//mainUnlock -> itemID that unlocks only this emote and no others (needed for dp purchase)
//priceDP -> dp price to unlock the single emote
//unlockItem -> itemID of pack unlock item (can add unlimited of these to one emote)
//iconFrame	-> frame to use as icon; default 0
//repeating -> 0: only played once 1: played full emote duration (5sec); default: 1
//adminOnly -> 0: for all users 1: for admins only; default: 0


